# Reference for optional server runtime bindings.
# Local development: copy .dev.vars.example to .dev.vars instead.
# Configure production values through your hosting platform, not client code.
# Choose either a public Space ID OR your own authenticated model endpoints.

# HUGGINGFACE_SPACE=owner/space-name
# CONVERSATION_URL=https://your-inference-host.example/v1/chat/completions
# CONVERSATION_API_KEY=replace-with-your-server-secret
# CONVERSATION_MODEL=paso-qwen3
# VOICE_URL=https://your-voice-host.example/v1/audio/speech
# VOICE_API_KEY=replace-with-your-server-secret
# TRANSCRIPTION_URL=https://your-speech-host.example/v1/audio/transcriptions
# TRANSCRIPTION_API_KEY=replace-with-your-server-secret
